  "_doc": "Role families (D-005, D-017, D-076). Each job gets ONE family, the first whose patterns match its normalized title (lowercase, punctuation removed, 'sr' -> 'senior'); 'exclude' is checked first. Families are absolute (a Business analyst role is 'Business analysis' for everyone). How close a family is to a person is relative: their own families, then each family's 'related', then 'stretch'. 'pay' is the default green/yellow pay target (CAD, top of posted range) offered when someone picks that family; they can change it. 'default_families' stands in for a profile that hasn't picked any (the first user's).",
